---
/**
 * Terms of Fairness — an ironic "classified dossier" rendering of what is, underneath, just
 * the contract's guarantees. Static, screenshot-bait, pure brand voice. Casino legalese with
 * cryptographic precision. No data, no JS.
 */
---

<section class="border-t border-stone-800 px-6 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
    <div class="mb-8 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-400/40">
          Document 003 // binding
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400">Terms of Fairness</h2>
      </div>
      <div
        class="shrink-0 select-none rotate-3 border-2 border-red-500/50 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-500/70"
      >
        Classification: Public
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="space-y-5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-400/55">
      <li class="border-l-2 border-amber-400/30 pl-4">
        <span class="font-bold text-amber-400/80">&sect;1 &mdash; Derivation.</span>
        The outcome of every flip is <span class="text-amber-400/80">SHA-256(beacon &oplus; salt)[0] mod 2</span>.
        Neither charm, persuasion, nor prayer constitutes a valid input to the outcome function.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-amber-400/30 pl-4">
        <span class="font-bold text-amber-400/80">&sect;2 &mdash; The house.</span>
        The house edge is fixed in contract bytecode at application
        <span class="text-amber-400/80">3584300812</span>. It cannot be raised mid-game, including
        by the house. The house has read the same source code as you.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-amber-400/30 pl-4">
        <span class="font-bold text-amber-400/80">&sect;3(b) &mdash; Operative recovery clause.</span>
        If the resolver fails, any wallet may trigger a full refund after 48 hours. Your funds are
        never the keeper's hostage. <span class="text-amber-400/25 line-through">[REDACTED &mdash; see &sect;3(c)]</span>
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-amber-400/30 pl-4">
        <span class="font-bold text-amber-400/80">&sect;4 &mdash; Finality.</span>
        Consensus is not an opinion. Once written, the result exists whether you refresh the page
        or not.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-amber-400/25">
      Filed on-chain &middot; Algorand mainnet &middot; Witnessed by every full node &middot; No
      signature required
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
